  description:
  - Crops will only grow during the night. Each crop takes varying hours to advance
    1 stage of growth.
  - In order to advance their growth, the plant must have their Water and Nutritional
    needs met. Otherwise, they will take stress damage. Too much stress and the plant
    will wither, providing no harvest.
  leftText: Crops will only grow during the night. Each crop takes varying hours
    to advance 1 stage of growth. In order to advance their growth, the plant must
    have their Water and Nutritional needs met. Otherwise, they will take stress
    damage. Too much stress and the plant will wither, providing no harvest.
  rightText: If a crop grows without taking any stress damage, they have a chance
    to yield a seed. On Relaxed Mode, crops cannot take stress damage from lack of
    water. They also cannot drop a bonus seed.
